  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "It's horrible, one little evening alone, home",
          "rhyme": "om",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "End up with carpal tunnel syndrome",
          "rhyme": "om",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "And here I am, known for giving heavy back aches",
          "rhyme": "aS",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Grown and living off of Little Debbie snack cakes",
          "rhyme": "Ek",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Supposed to be checking emails",
          "rhyme": "El",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "All I got is messages from ass naked females",
          "rhyme": "al",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "I don't know a Jenny",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "She said it's free and I won't owe her a penny",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "And that's the last time I saw her",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "But thousands of more horrors on online Gomorrah",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "And Sodom, they got 'em with their curls out",
          "rhyme": "awt",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "And they got a better sales pitch than the Girl Scouts",
          "rhyme": "ut",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "I wonder what I owe her",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "For a whole box of caramel coconut samoa",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "(\"Nite nite!\") Uh, okay honey, sweet dreams",
          "rhyme": "imz",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Now it's time to get serious like Peek Freans",
          "rhyme": "ins",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "A metal handful, wipe it on the quilt",
          "rhyme": "ilt",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Wife wake up and I'm kill't over spilt milk",
          "rhyme": "Ok",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "Locked in, looking at your picture",
          "rhyme": "yR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "Fully clothed winter and I'm right there with ya",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "Thinking about the last time I split your wishbone",
          "rhyme": "on",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "A man could only wish you do the same 'til he get home",
          "rhyme": "om",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "Fat chance, at least he get snacks",
          "rhyme": "ak",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "That'd have to do 'til a brother get back",
          "rhyme": "ak",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "Until then smack One-Eyed Jack",
          "rhyme": "ak",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "And hope one of his peoples can hook him with a tri-pack",
          "rhyme": "ak",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "That's three different flavors",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "Chocolate, vanilla and strawberry wafers",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "Acting all hard, 'bout to get beat up",
          "rhyme": "9p",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "I'll show him what time it is once I get this sheet up",
          "rhyme": "9p",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "Soon as he fell off the beat down",
          "rhyme": "awn",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "All I hear is, \"13th cell get the sheet down\"",
          "rhyme": "awn",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "Damn C.O., what the hell do she know?",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "Besides the fact she wanna get dug out on the d-low",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "A workaholic with a fountain in the ink pen",
          "rhyme": "@n",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "Out in the mountains and I stopped drinking again",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "36",
          "text": "In the wee hours, he's gotten farther",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "37",
          "text": "Needing three showers, being hot and bothered",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "38",
          "text": "The wiz with her leg bent, pregnant",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "39",
          "text": "God bless the day she wondered where her egg went",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "40",
          "text": "I need a L, it's hard to drink without it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "41",
          "text": "And could use some kookies but trying not to think about it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "42",
          "text": "Watching \"BET\" on jazz for knowledge on file",
          "rhyme": "il",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "43",
          "text": "Every other commercial, college hoes gone wild",
          "rhyme": "Old",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "44",
          "text": "Soft batch, I prefer the other bunch",
          "rhyme": "$S",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "45",
          "text": "Like we got for lunch, chocolate fudge butter crunch",
          "rhyme": "9nS",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AABCDEFFGHIJGHKLMNOHPAQQQQRSTTUUVVWXYGZZ[[\\]^_",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AABCCBDDEBBFEBDDDGHBAABBBBGIIIBBAAJKCELLDDDGMI"
    },
    {
