    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "He don't mess with the Ritz Bits",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Wheat Thins, Saltines or Triscuits",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Matzos or Cheez-Its",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Catch sugar fits every time that he sees",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Chips Ahoy, double chocolate chunk",
          "rhyme": "9nk",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Something with the bubble and the junk in the trunk",
          "rhyme": "9nk",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Even the Oreos, no matter what weather",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Always kept 'em dipped in milk and stuck together",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "In the game he's shameless",
          "rhyme": "Es",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Even uses a code name: Famous Amos",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "It's cheaper than a short stay at the Days Inn",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "And good like 25 cent oatmeal raisin",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Give a hand to who invented the camera",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Skip past the graham, animal and Grandma’s",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Shh, make sure she don't wake from her dream chill",
          "rhyme": "il",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Or get caught with a handful of cream fill",
          "rhyme": "il",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABBBCCDDEFGHIJKK",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AAAABBCCCDAEFGAA"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "interlude",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "\"Oh, honey! What are you doing? That's so nasty!\"",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "It might seem ill",
          "rhyme": "il",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "\"Ew! Go wash your hands!\" (No)",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Kookies",
          "rhyme": "iz",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "\"Get out of here!\"",
          "rhyme": "eR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDE",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AABAC"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_4",
      "type": "outro",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "(DOOM): DOOM is master of the world",
          "rhyme": "Old",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "(Spider-Man): I'd sure hate to see that ugly mug of yours in my history book",
          "rhyme": "uk",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "(DOOM): You've disturbed me for the last time",
          "rhyme": "ajm",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "(Ben, The Thing): Hey, y'know something gang, that DOOM ain't really all bad",
          "rhyme": "ad",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "(Sue, The Invisible Woman): What do you mean, Ben?",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "(Ben, The Thing): Well, on account of him I had me a real good time. Y'know, I mean, between you and me I kinda like being black",
          "rhyme": "ak",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "(H.E.R.B.I.E.): Well, maybe if we're lucky he'll attack us once more and send you back, Benjamin",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "(Ben, The Thing): Ah-haha very funny, very very funny",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "(Sue, The Invisible Woman): He must be mad",
          "rhyme": "ad",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "(Dr. Reed, Mister Fantastic): Well, if anyone can do it. Nevertheless let's get out of here, while we can",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "(Misc. voice): Food, we need food",
          "rhyme": "ud",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
